      <pubDate>Thu, 27 Feb 2025 20:21:44 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Talk 28: &amp;quot;Good thing we&amp;#39;re not writing a database&amp;quot; by Peter van Hardenberg (&lt;span class="h-card" translate="no"&gt;&lt;a href="https://merveilles.town/@pvh" class="u-url mention"&gt;@&lt;span&gt;pvh&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;</description>
